1. Purpose and Scope
This document provides a technical deep‑dive of the Azure DevOps YAML pipeline defined in 
gated-pipeline-kiosk.txt 
. 
The pipeline acts as a gated quality control mechanism for the Android Kiosk (NA) application by enforcing Pull Request 
governance, executing unit tests with coverage, and validating code quality using SonarQube before changes are allowed to 
progress.
This pipeline is not a release pipeline. Its sole purpose is pre‑merge validation and quality enforcement.
